// accessors reads every node.
//
// The tree is one tab stop: the focused node holds it and the keys move it by
// the one rule every client target holds (`cruftfreePressTreeKey`) -- Down and Up the
// next and previous shown node, Right opens a closed node or enters an open
// one, Left closes an open node or leaves to its parent, Home and End the
// first and last shown node, Enter and Space select the focused node (the
// tree's `onSelect` fires with it). A tap selects a node, and its disclosure
// toggles it.
//
