// (`all`), the nodes `expandedWhen` holds for (`condition`), or each root
// (`firstLevel`). A node is shown selected while `selectedWhen` holds for it,
// or -- with none -- while it is the last node the reader selected. Every node
// tells assistive technology whether it is expanded and whether it is selected.

